{"seq":2,"slug":"virtual-list","title":"虚拟列表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/performance/virtual-list","wordCount":576,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"虚拟列表\">虚拟列表</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>虚拟列表（Virtual List）只渲染可视区域内的元素，用动态替换视口节点的办法模拟完整长列表，从而把数万条数据的渲染成本压到近乎恒定。它的实现难点在于如何计算可视范围与 offset，以及如何处理高度不定的行。本章讲解虚拟列表的必要性、<code>react-window</code> 的固定高度与网格用法、可变高度列表、<code>react-virtuoso</code> 的自动测量能力，以及与之配合的无限滚动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要虚拟列表\">为什么需要虚拟列表</h2><p>当列表包含成千上万条数据时，一次性渲染所有 DOM 节点会导致严重的性能问题：初始渲染慢、滚动卡顿、内存占用高。<strong>虚拟列表（Virtual List）</strong> 只渲染可视区域内的元素，通过动态替换视口中的节点来模拟完整列表。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 传统渲染&#10;        A[&quot;10000 条数据&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;渲染 10000 个 DOM 节点&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; C[&quot;内存: ~500MB&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; D[&quot;渲染: ~3s&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 虚拟列表&#10;        E[&quot;10000 条数据&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;只渲染 ~20 个可见节点&quot;]&#10;        F --&gt; G[&quot;内存: ~5MB&quot;]&#10;        F --&gt; H[&quot;渲染: ~16ms&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 传统渲染\n        A[\"10000 条数据\"] --&gt; B[\"渲染 10000 个 DOM 节点\"]\n        B --&gt; C[\"内存: ~500MB\"]\n        B --&gt; D[\"渲染: ~3s\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 虚拟列表\n        E[\"10000 条数据\"] --&gt; F[\"只渲染 ~20 个可见节点\"]\n        F --&gt; G[\"内存: ~5MB\"]\n        F --&gt; H[\"渲染: ~16ms\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>传统渲染 (10000条)</th>\n<th>虚拟列表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DOM 节点数</td>\n<td>10000+</td>\n<td>~20-30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>初始渲染时间</td>\n<td>2-5s</td>\n<td>&lt;100ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存占用</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>恒定低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滚动性能</td>\n<td>卡顿</td>\n<td>流畅</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"react-window\">react-window</h2><p><code>react-window</code> 是最流行的虚拟列表库，体积小（~2KB），API 简洁：</p>\n<h3 id=\"固定高度列表\">固定高度列表</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { FixedSizeList } from &#39;react-window&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface RowProps {&#10;  index: number;&#10;  style: React.CSSProperties;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function Row({ index, style }: RowProps) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div style={style} className={index % 2 === 0 ? &#39;row-even&#39; : &#39;row-odd&#39;}&gt;&#10;      Row {index}&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function VirtualList({ itemCount }: { itemCount: number }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;FixedSizeList height={600} width=&quot;100%&quot; itemCount={itemCount} itemSize={50}&gt;&#10;      {Row}&#10;    &lt;/FixedSizeList&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { FixedSizeList } from 'react-window';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface RowProps {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  index: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  style: React.CSSProperties;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function Row({ index, style }: RowProps) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div style={style} className={index % 2 === 0 ? 'row-even' : 'row-odd'}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      Row {index}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function VirtualList({ itemCount }: { itemCount: number }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;FixedSizeList height={600} width=\"100%\" itemCount={itemCount} itemSize={50}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {Row}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/FixedSizeList></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"固定高度网格\">固定高度网格</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { FixedSizeGrid } from &#39;react-window&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface CellProps {&#10;  columnIndex: number;&#10;  rowIndex: number;&#10;  style: React.CSSProperties;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function Cell({ columnIndex, rowIndex, style }: CellProps) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div style={style}&gt;&#10;      ({rowIndex}, {columnIndex})&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function VirtualGrid() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;FixedSizeGrid columnCount={100} columnWidth={120} height={600} rowCount={1000} rowHeight={50} width={800}&gt;&#10;      {Cell}&#10;    &lt;/FixedSizeGrid&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { FixedSizeGrid } from 'react-window';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface CellProps {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  columnIndex: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rowIndex: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  style: React.CSSProperties;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function Cell({ columnIndex, rowIndex, style }: CellProps) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div style={style}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ({rowIndex}, {columnIndex})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function VirtualGrid() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;FixedSizeGrid columnCount={100} columnWidth={120} height={600} rowCount={1000} rowHeight={50} width={800}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {Cell}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/FixedSizeGrid></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[滚动事件] --&gt; B[计算可见范围]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;startIndex = Math.floor(scrollTop / itemSize)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;endIndex = startIndex + visibleCount&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[只渲染 startIndex ~ endIndex 的项]&#10;    E --&gt; F[使用 absolute 定位 + transform]\">flowchart LR\n    A[滚动事件] --&gt; B[计算可见范围]\n    B --&gt; C[\"startIndex = Math.floor(scrollTop / itemSize)\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"endIndex = startIndex + visibleCount\"]\n    D --&gt; E[只渲染 startIndex ~ endIndex 的项]\n    E --&gt; F[使用 absolute 定位 + transform]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"可变高度列表\">可变高度列表</h2><p>当列表项高度不一致时，使用 <code>VariableSizeList</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { VariableSizeList } from &#39;react-window&#39;;&#10;&#10;const rowHeights = new Array(10000).fill(null).map(() =&gt; 50 + Math.round(Math.random() * 100));&#10;&#10;function getItemSize(index: number): number {&#10;  return rowHeights[index];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function VariableRow({ index, style }: { index: number; style: React.CSSProperties }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div style={style}&gt;&#10;      &lt;div style={{ padding: 8 }}&gt;&#10;        &lt;strong&gt;Item {index}&lt;/strong&gt;&#10;        &lt;p&gt;高度: {rowHeights[index]}px&lt;/p&gt;&#10;      &lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function VariableList() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;VariableSizeList height={600} width=&quot;100%&quot; itemCount={10000} itemSize={getItemSize} estimatedItemSize={100}&gt;&#10;      {VariableRow}&#10;    &lt;/VariableSizeList&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { VariableSizeList } from 'react-window';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const rowHeights = new Array(10000).fill(null).map(() => 50 + Math.round(Math.random() * 100));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function getItemSize(index: number): number {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return rowHeights[index];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function VariableRow({ index, style }: { index: number; style: React.CSSProperties }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div style={style}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div style={{ padding: 8 }}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;strong>Item {index}&#x3C;/strong></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;p>高度: {rowHeights[index]}px&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function VariableList() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;VariableSizeList height={600} width=\"100%\" itemCount={10000} itemSize={getItemSize} estimatedItemSize={100}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {VariableRow}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/VariableSizeList></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"react-virtuoso\">react-virtuoso</h2><p><code>react-virtuoso</code> 是另一个流行的虚拟列表库，支持自动测量高度、分组、反向列表等高级功能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { Virtuoso, GroupedVirtuoso } from &#39;react-virtuoso&#39;;&#10;&#10;function AutoSizeList({ items }: { items: Item[] }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Virtuoso&#10;      style={{ height: 600 }}&#10;      totalCount={items.length}&#10;      itemContent={(index) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;div style={{ padding: 16 }}&gt;&#10;          &lt;h3&gt;{items[index].title}&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;          &lt;p&gt;{items[index].description}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;        &lt;/div&gt;&#10;      )}&#10;    /&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function ChatMessages({ messages }: { messages: Message[] }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Virtuoso&#10;      style={{ height: 500 }}&#10;      totalCount={messages.length}&#10;      initialTopMostItemIndex={messages.length - 1}&#10;      followOutput=&quot;smooth&quot;&#10;      itemContent={(index) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;div className=&quot;message&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;span className=&quot;author&quot;&gt;{messages[index].author}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;          &lt;p&gt;{messages[index].text}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;        &lt;/div&gt;&#10;      )}&#10;    /&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { Virtuoso, GroupedVirtuoso } from 'react-virtuoso';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function AutoSizeList({ items }: { items: Item[] }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Virtuoso</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      style={{ height: 600 }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      totalCount={items.length}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      itemContent={(index) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;div style={{ padding: 16 }}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;h3>{items[index].title}&#x3C;/h3></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;p>{items[index].description}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function ChatMessages({ messages }: { messages: Message[] }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Virtuoso</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      style={{ height: 500 }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      totalCount={messages.length}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      initialTopMostItemIndex={messages.length - 1}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      followOutput=\"smooth\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      itemContent={(index) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;div className=\"message\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;span className=\"author\">{messages[index].author}&#x3C;/span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;p>{messages[index].text}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>react-window</th>\n<th>react-virtuoso</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>包体积</td>\n<td>~2KB</td>\n<td>~8KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动测量高度</td>\n<td>❌（需手动）</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分组支持</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反向列表（聊天）</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无限滚动</td>\n<td>需配合 <code>react-window-infinite-loader</code></td>\n<td>✅（内置）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"infinite-scroll-无限滚动\">Infinite Scroll 无限滚动</h2><p>虚拟列表配合无限滚动实现动态加载数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { Virtuoso } from &#39;react-virtuoso&#39;;&#10;&#10;function InfiniteList() {&#10;  const [items, setItems] = useState&lt;Item[]&gt;([]);&#10;  const [hasMore, setHasMore] = useState(true);&#10;&#10;  const loadMore = useCallback(async () =&gt; {&#10;    const nextItems = await fetchItems(items.length, 20);&#10;    if (nextItems.length === 0) {&#10;      setHasMore(false);&#10;      return;&#10;    }&#10;    setItems((prev) =&gt; [...prev, ...nextItems]);&#10;  }, [items.length]);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Virtuoso&#10;      style={{ height: &#39;100vh&#39; }}&#10;      totalCount={items.length}&#10;      endReached={hasMore ? loadMore : undefined}&#10;      itemContent={(index) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;div className=&quot;item&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;h3&gt;{items[index].title}&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;          &lt;p&gt;{items[index].description}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;        &lt;/div&gt;&#10;      )}&#10;      components={{&#10;        Footer: () =&gt; (hasMore ? &lt;div className=&quot;loading&quot;&gt;加载中...&lt;/div&gt; : null),&#10;      }}&#10;    /&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { Virtuoso } from 'react-virtuoso';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function InfiniteList() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [items, setItems] = useState&#x3C;Item[]>([]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [hasMore, setHasMore] = useState(true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const loadMore = useCallback(async () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const nextItems = await fetchItems(items.length, 20);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (nextItems.length === 0) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      setHasMore(false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setItems((prev) => [...prev, ...nextItems]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, [items.length]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Virtuoso</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      style={{ height: '100vh' }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      totalCount={items.length}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      endReached={hasMore ? loadMore : undefined}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      itemContent={(index) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;div className=\"item\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;h3>{items[index].title}&#x3C;/h3></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;p>{items[index].description}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      components={{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Footer: () => (hasMore ? &#x3C;div className=\"loading\">加载中...&#x3C;/div> : null),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[用户滚动到底部] --&gt; B[触发 endReached]&#10;    B --&gt; C[请求下一页数据]&#10;    C --&gt; D{还有更多数据?}&#10;    D -- 是 --&gt; E[追加到 items]&#10;    E --&gt; F[虚拟列表重新计算可见项]&#10;    D -- 否 --&gt; G[setHasMore false]&#10;    G --&gt; H[不再触发加载]\">flowchart TD\n    A[用户滚动到底部] --&gt; B[触发 endReached]\n    B --&gt; C[请求下一页数据]\n    C --&gt; D{还有更多数据?}\n    D -- 是 --&gt; E[追加到 items]\n    E --&gt; F[虚拟列表重新计算可见项]\n    D -- 否 --&gt; G[setHasMore false]\n    G --&gt; H[不再触发加载]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 虚拟列表要注意滚动条的准确性。对于可变高度的列表，<code>estimatedItemSize</code> 越接近实际平均高度，滚动条越精确。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>虚拟列表</strong> 只渲染可视区域的 DOM 节点，将数万条数据的渲染性能降至恒定</li>\n<li><code>react-window</code> 轻量简洁，适合固定高度或已知高度的列表</li>\n<li><code>react-virtuoso</code> 功能丰富，支持自动测量、分组、反向列表和内置无限滚动</li>\n<li>固定高度用 <code>FixedSizeList</code>，可变高度用 <code>VariableSizeList</code> 或 <code>react-virtuoso</code></li>\n<li>无限滚动通过监听到底事件触发分页加载，与虚拟列表结合可处理无限数据</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"虚拟列表","id":"虚拟列表"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要虚拟列表","id":"为什么需要虚拟列表"},{"level":2,"text":"react-window","id":"react-window"},{"level":3,"text":"固定高度列表","id":"固定高度列表"},{"level":3,"text":"固定高度网格","id":"固定高度网格"},{"level":2,"text":"可变高度列表","id":"可变高度列表"},{"level":2,"text":"react-virtuoso","id":"react-virtuoso"},{"level":2,"text":"Infinite Scroll 无限滚动","id":"infinite-scroll-无限滚动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"memo 与 useCallback","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/performance/memo-and-callback"},"next":{"title":"代码分割","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/performance/code-splitting"}}